course: dictionary
lesson: 776
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The clues around the word tell you which meaning fits. Read the whole sentence, then ask: which meaning makes sense here?
explain: «Beau means beautiful or handsome, but il fait beau simply means the weather is sunny and nice.» The word is the same, but the sentence changes the meaning. Look at the words next to it to decide.
explain: Some words also come from other languages. Beau is a French word that English has borrowed. In an English story it can mean a boyfriend, but in a French lesson it describes nice weather or a handsome boy. Always check where the word is being used.
fact: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one is meant.
fact: Beau is a noun in English, meaning a boyfriend or a man who is courting a woman. This meaning is old-fashioned.
fact: Beau is also a French adjective meaning «beautiful» or «handsome» in its masculine form.
fact: «Il fait beau» means «The weather is fine» in French. It is a set phrase, so you learn it as a whole.
fact: Beau can be a boy's name too, so a capital letter at the start of a name is a clue.
exercise: «Il fait beau et chaud.» In French, what does beau tell us about the weather? | It is raining hard | Nothing, it is a name | *The weather is fine | The weather is cold
exercise: In old novels, what is a young woman's beau? | A teacher at her school | A stepbrother who lives in her house | A pet horse | *The man who wants to marry her
exercise: Find and copy the word in «Il fait beau et chaud» that means hot. | et | *chaud | Il | fait
test: Jamal reads, «Beau came to our house for tea.» Which meaning of beau fits best? | A French word for fine weather | A kind of old-fashioned boat | The knot used to tie shoes | *A boy's name
test: The word beau sounds like which English word, as in the knot? | Bath | Bike | Boat | *Bow
exam: Maya says beau always means ugly in French. What is the right answer? | *No, beau means beautiful or handsome, and the sentence shows which meaning fits | Yes, beau means ugly in every sentence | No, beau is only a boy's name | No, beau means cold
